<title>LATVIA: SHARES QUIET, SHOW MIXED TO HIGHER TREND.</title>
<headline>SHARES QUIET, SHOW MIXED TO HIGHER TREND.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>A low number of shares showed</p>
<p>acitivity at the price fixing session on Monday although prices</p>
<p>were mixed to slightly higher.</p>
<p>RTF gained to 1.40 lats from 1.29 lats while Unibanka added</p>
<p>five santimes to 3.50 lats.</p>
<p>Shares can be bought (B) or sold (S) at the following prices</p>
<p>and in the following volume, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
